    "title": "Avro Schema Definition"
  },
  "description": "The data model defines a **User** record (alias\u202f*Person*) under the **com.example** namespace, described as \u201cA user record.\u201d This record comprises several fields:  \n\n* **id** \u2013 a **long** integer serving as a unique identifier (documented as \u201cUnique identifier\u201d).  \n* **name** \u2013 a **string** containing the user\u2019s name.  \n* **email** \u2013 a **string** for the user\u2019s e\u2011mail address, which defaults to an empty string when omitted.  \n* **addresses** \u2013 an **array** of **Address** records (also in the com.example namespace). Each **Address** includes three string fields: **street**, **city**, and **zip**.  \n* **phoneNumbers** \u2013 an **array** of **string** values representing the user\u2019s phone numbers, defaulting to an empty list.  \n* **status** \u2013 a reference to the custom type **UserStatus**, documented as \u201cCurrent status of the user.\u201d  \n* **favoriteNumber** \u2013 a union type accepting either **null** or an **int**, with a default value of **null**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "type": "record",
    "name": "User",
    "namespace": "com.example",
    "doc": "A user record",
    "aliases": [
      "Person"
    ],
    "fields": [
      {
        "name": "id",
        "type": "long",
        "doc": "Unique identifier"
      },
      {
        "name": "name",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "name": "email",
        "type": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "default": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "addresses",
        "type": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "record",
            "name": "Address",
            "namespace": "com.example",
            "fields": [
              {
                "name": "street",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "name": "city",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "name": "zip",
                "type": "string"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "phoneNumbers",
        "type": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": "string"
        },
        "default": []
      },
      {
        "name": "status",
        "type": "UserStatus",
        "doc": "Current status of the user"
      },
      {
        "name": "favoriteNumber",
        "type": [
          "null",
          "int"
        ],
        "default": null
      }
    ]
  }
